00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:33.052
that that's what I am. I am poison.

00:07:33.052 --> 00:07:34.587
So when he says that,

00:07:34.587 --> 00:07:36.222
remember that our generation,

00:07:36.222 --> 00:07:37.824
the under 30, it's

00:07:37.824 --> 00:07:39.525
a very biracial generation.

00:07:39.525 --> 00:07:41.994
So he's actually saying to young people,

00:07:41.994 --> 00:07:43.362
