00:07:43.362 --> 00:07:44.096
And I do think

00:07:44.096 --> 00:07:45.865
when we get to the general election

00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:47.400
and if believing that

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.835
it is Trump and Biden,

00:07:48.835 --> 00:07:50.670
that is what Joe Biden is talking about

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:51.170
when he talks

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.905
