00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:53.639
and that

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:55.908
when we're having that conversation,

00:07:55.908 --> 00:07:57.677
that is a very different conversation

00:07:57.677 --> 00:07:58.678
than what's happening right now

00:07:58.678 --> 00:08:00.213
in the Republican primary,

00:08:00.213 --> 00:08:01.547
where there will be somebody

00:08:01.547 --> 00:08:03.382
who will speak up and speak out

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:06.285
