00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:13.559
That's that's

00:08:13.559 --> 00:08:16.062
it does hit young people,

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:17.730
more of whom are biracial.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.764
And then the question is,

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:20.533
why is Donald Trump doing so well

00:08:20.533 --> 00:08:21.367
with younger voters?

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:23.736
And Joe Biden is losing younger voters?

00:08:23.736 --> 00:08:24.237
That's a

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:26.672
that's a job for the campaign, obviously.

00:08:26.672 --> 00:08:28.441
But they've got to figure that one out.

00:08:28.441 --> 00:08:29.208
You know, it's interesting.

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:30.176
And Nikki is speaking

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:31.477
